  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Developing a Grassroots Planning Process in Three Communities in Apopa to Assess Needs, Identify Economic Initiatives for Young Adults, Strengthen the Administration of Community Development Associations, and Develop Community Action Plans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asociacin Adolescente Juvenil Amigos de Apopa (AJA), $38,915 over one year AJA will engage residents of three communities in the municipality of Apopa, department of San Salvador, in a grassroots planning process that will assess needs and delineate priorities, strengthen the administration of community development associations, and result in community action plans. The grant will benefit 90 people directly and 1,380 people indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
